+/*
+ * Vectors 48..51 (irq 16..19) stay outside the allocatable pool.
+ * IPIs use this band. The interim wake scheme posts IPIs with
+ * vector 0x30 (irq 16). The per-vCPU LAPIC one-shot scheme may
